WEBVTT

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:29.755
It can't be...

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:40.732
It got away.

00:00:42.042 --> 00:00:44.067
Ranmaru!

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:45.099
Sakura...

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:46.134
You okay?

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:47.874
Yeah, just barely...

00:00:49.749 --> 00:00:54.652
That's surprising. He just survived
an attack from Number Twelve.

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:56.018
I knew he would.

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.387
So he really is...

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.893
They're mingling with us.

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:35.952
Devil

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:39.925
Udagawa Police Hospital

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.362
Big brother!

00:02:48.401 --> 00:02:49.390
Saya!

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.959
What in the world happened?

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:53.837
As you can see, I had the crap
kicked out of me.

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:56.603
And how are your injuries?
Can you move?

00:02:56.643 --> 00:02:57.974
Do you have both hands?

00:02:58.011 --> 00:02:59.876
I'm all right. Look.

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:03.871
Saya...

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:07.683
Ohh, and after I told you
not to worry me, too...

00:03:09.189 --> 00:03:10.178
Shindo!

00:03:10.223 --> 00:03:11.588
Yo...

00:03:11.624 --> 00:03:12.613
You...

00:03:12.659 --> 00:03:14.650
Sorry, but I'm taking today
off from work.

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.958
I can't even clean the bathrooms
like this, you know?

00:03:17.931 --> 00:03:20.331
I heard it from Kunikida.
You had an accident?

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:21.355
An accident?

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:24.859
He said you were hit by a car.
Was it something else?

00:03:24.904 --> 00:03:27.600
I see. So that's what
they're making it.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.006
Big brother, they said
you shouldn't talk too much.

00:03:30.043 --> 00:03:32.603
I'm all right.

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:39.207
Shindo?

00:03:39.252 --> 00:03:40.617
Big brother, what's wrong?

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:41.642
Huh?

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:43.121
You don't look so good.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:44.748
I'm telling you I'm all right.

00:03:44.791 --> 00:03:45.883
I'm just a little...

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:47.756
Should I go and get the doctor?

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:50.661
More importantly, I'm hungry.
Is there anything to eat?

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:53.257
Gotcha. I'll go buy something.

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:55.597
Hanazono, please take care
of my brother.

00:03:55.635 --> 00:03:56.624
Right.

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:06.008
In any case,
take it easy for a while.

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:08.639
Kunikida
will be coming by later.

00:04:08.681 --> 00:04:10.205
I know you probably don't want
to see him,

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.979
but it looks like he's got a lot
of questions to ask you.

00:04:12.018 --> 00:04:13.007
I see...

00:04:13.052 --> 00:04:14.383
Hey, you all right?

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.752
Yeah, somehow...

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:20.691
H-Hey...

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:25.924
Where are your injuries?

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:34.337
Rokujo.

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:36.171
Sorry, but would you
mind leaving?

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:37.198
Huh? Why?

00:04:39.712 --> 00:04:41.703
Sorry, man.

00:04:41.748 --> 00:04:44.979
Okay, okay, I got you.

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:49.718
So you came
to check in on me?

00:04:51.524 --> 00:04:54.118
I'm guessing you understand,
but yesterday...

00:04:54.160 --> 00:04:56.685
Yeah, it officially
never happened, right?

00:04:58.464 --> 00:05:01.058
Why are they trying so hard
to hide it?

00:05:07.106 --> 00:05:09.438
Rokujo?

00:05:09.475 --> 00:05:12.342
Shindo, I'm going to say this
to you straightforward.

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:14.846
Don't get any closer
than this to them.

00:05:14.881 --> 00:05:17.714
Huh? What do you mean?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.809
Do you know what this is?

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:22.418
The mark of destruction.

00:05:25.391 --> 00:05:27.052
Big brother!

00:05:31.164 --> 00:05:32.324
Saya?

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:36.898
Are you really okay?

00:05:36.936 --> 00:05:38.904
Yes, thank you.

00:05:38.938 --> 00:05:40.496
Well, your body
isn't so covered in injuries...

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.235
...that you can't
regain consciousness,

00:05:42.275 --> 00:05:43.299
you're not in intensive care,

00:05:43.343 --> 00:05:45.903
and it's not like you're not long
for this world...

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:48.140
Who said that?

00:05:49.449 --> 00:05:51.417
Hello, this is the Special Mobile
Investigation Force.

00:05:51.451 --> 00:05:52.782
Yes.

00:05:52.819 --> 00:05:54.684
Chief, it's the Chief Inspector
for you.

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:56.313
Okay.

00:05:56.356 --> 00:05:59.416
Yes, this is Kunikida.

00:05:59.459 --> 00:06:00.653
What?

00:06:00.693 --> 00:06:03.184
R-Really!?
Thank you very much!

00:06:03.229 --> 00:06:04.696
Huh?

00:06:04.731 --> 00:06:05.925
Listen up, everyone!

00:06:05.965 --> 00:06:08.160
The crime lab is going to undergo
a mandatory investigation.

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:09.190
Yeah!

00:06:09.235 --> 00:06:11.294
Before that, I want you to gather
any information...

00:06:11.337 --> 00:06:12.929
...on the crime lab
you can find:

00:06:12.972 --> 00:06:15.941
Suppliers, shippers,
disposal companies, anything!

00:06:15.975 --> 00:06:18.409
With this, we don't need
to hold back anymore.

00:06:18.444 --> 00:06:20.435
The Security Section be damned!

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.311
Shindo, you're staying behind!

00:06:22.348 --> 00:06:25.806
What? Why?
I'm all right now, sir!

00:06:25.852 --> 00:06:29.413
You idiot! This is your punishment
for making me worry so much!

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:32.288
Today you're going to clean every
bathroom in the building!

00:06:32.325 --> 00:06:33.553
You can't...

00:06:36.129 --> 00:06:39.098
The hell. This is pretty much
the same as me convalescing.

00:06:39.132 --> 00:06:40.190
At least...

00:06:48.641 --> 00:06:50.074
Ranmaru!

00:06:50.109 --> 00:06:51.098
Huh?

00:06:51.144 --> 00:06:52.338
Yukino...

00:06:52.378 --> 00:06:55.575
I heard from Saya
that you were hurt...

00:06:58.451 --> 00:06:59.918
Here you go.

00:06:59.952 --> 00:07:03.649
The coffee here isn't as good
as the stuff you served me, Yukino.

00:07:03.689 --> 00:07:05.520
And so how are your injuries?

00:07:05.558 --> 00:07:07.492
I went to the hospital first,

00:07:07.527 --> 00:07:09.256
and they said that you had
already been discharged...

00:07:09.295 --> 00:07:10.523
As you can see...

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:12.121
But she said that your injuries
were serious...

00:07:12.165 --> 00:07:14.759
Saya was blowing things
out of proportion...

00:07:14.801 --> 00:07:16.166
It's just a scratch.

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:19.296
Really? Thank goodness...

00:07:19.338 --> 00:07:21.636
By the way, are you all right?

00:07:21.674 --> 00:07:22.663
What?

00:07:22.708 --> 00:07:26.075
Actually, I went
to the crime lab that night...

00:07:26.112 --> 00:07:28.046
What?

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:30.810
Ranmaru, those injuries...

00:07:39.759 --> 00:07:40.851
Ranmaru...

00:07:40.893 --> 00:07:45.728
Actually, there's something
I have to talk to you about.

00:07:49.869 --> 00:07:51.097
How about we head out?

00:07:55.174 --> 00:07:58.473
This is my secret place.

00:07:58.511 --> 00:07:59.500
Umm...

00:07:59.545 --> 00:08:00.944
You've been sworn to secrecy...

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.709
...about what happened
that night, right?

00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:06.381
What happened there?

00:08:10.456 --> 00:08:12.253
Please look at this.

00:08:13.459 --> 00:08:14.653
This is...

00:08:19.265 --> 00:08:21.563
This is what my father was
researching for a long time now.

00:08:21.601 --> 00:08:22.795
What!?

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.938
And so where's
Number Twelve?

00:08:25.972 --> 00:08:28.805
There is no trace of it
within a ten-kilometer radius.

00:08:28.841 --> 00:08:30.172
It appears to have completely
disappeared.

00:08:30.209 --> 00:08:32.473
Are there any other
singularities?

00:08:32.512 --> 00:08:34.275
Right now,
we can't ascertain that.

00:08:34.313 --> 00:08:36.645
Okay, I understand.

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:40.243
At the very least, we know
that it's not in that area.

00:08:40.286 --> 00:08:41.913
I wonder what it's planning.

00:08:41.954 --> 00:08:45.321
It was a warning, wasn't it?

00:08:45.358 --> 00:08:46.347
A warning?

00:08:46.392 --> 00:08:49.122
Yeah... from them.

00:08:49.161 --> 00:08:53.097
What in the world
is your father doing there?

00:08:54.400 --> 00:08:55.662
He's analyzing the bodies...

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:57.635
...of unique life-forms
that have been recovered.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.400
The bodies of unique life-forms?

00:09:00.439 --> 00:09:02.907
The monsters that you
and the others saw...

00:09:02.942 --> 00:09:04.807
...at the crime scenes,
Ranmaru.

00:09:05.945 --> 00:09:07.310
This picture...

00:09:07.346 --> 00:09:10.179
...is from when my father was still
doing research at the university.

00:09:10.216 --> 00:09:14.277
The police asked him to analyze it
and brought it to him.

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:18.279
And so, what is the true identity
of this monster?

00:09:20.092 --> 00:09:21.320
We don't know.

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.349
What?

00:09:22.395 --> 00:09:24.226
No matter how much
we study it,

00:09:24.263 --> 00:09:27.164
it goes far beyond our level
of understanding.

00:09:27.199 --> 00:09:28.826
Can you tell me
about it in detail?

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:33.168
Actually, before he joined
the crime lab, he was a professor...

00:09:33.205 --> 00:09:35.639
...of biotechnology
at another university.

00:09:36.876 --> 00:09:39.777
The theme of my father's research
was evolution.

00:09:39.812 --> 00:09:42.610
But it wasn't the kind of evolution
that refers to Neo-Darwinism...

00:09:42.648 --> 00:09:46.880
...or population genetics,
which is about a species.

00:09:46.919 --> 00:09:50.685
It was research based
on a single creature...

00:09:50.723 --> 00:09:53.692
...evolving during
a single generation.

00:09:55.161 --> 00:09:57.288
For example, a single insect...

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:00.128
...for some reason
has an abnormality in its genes...

00:10:00.166 --> 00:10:02.896
...and in a short span of time
turns into a dinosaur.

00:10:05.137 --> 00:10:07.128
An insect turning
into a dinosaur?

00:10:07.173 --> 00:10:09.539
Naturally, biologically speaking,
that can't possibly happen...

00:10:09.575 --> 00:10:12.271
...because even if tens
of thousands of years pass,

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:14.745
their genes are different
to begin with.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.338
But my father was serious.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:22.614
Of course, at first even my father
didn't think that was possible.

00:10:23.322 --> 00:10:26.120
Until they brought him
this "devil's hand"...

00:10:27.159 --> 00:10:31.255
But after a while, something
surprising occurred in the lab.

00:10:32.832 --> 00:10:34.060
What's this?

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:37.035
The bacteria that broke down
the structure of the devil's hand...

00:10:37.069 --> 00:10:39.765
...suddenly mutated
and became an insect.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:43.775
And that wasn't all
that mutated, either.

00:10:50.549 --> 00:10:52.073
It just doesn't end.

00:10:52.118 --> 00:10:54.882
No, it just doesn't end.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:58.481
Oh, it's cool up here.

00:10:58.524 --> 00:10:59.821
Whoa!

00:11:01.027 --> 00:11:05.157
This devil's hand cannot possibly
be explained by modern science...

00:11:05.197 --> 00:11:06.755
...and is a terribly
frightening thing.

00:11:06.799 --> 00:11:09.734
But why do you have
those pictures, Yukino?

00:11:09.769 --> 00:11:12.499
At that time, I was one
of my father's assistants,

00:11:12.538 --> 00:11:14.768
working at his lab.

00:11:14.807 --> 00:11:17.503
These pictures were taken then.

00:11:17.543 --> 00:11:22.810
Ranmaru, this sample was brought
to the university five years ago,

00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:24.179
right after the incident
at Machida.

00:11:24.216 --> 00:11:25.376
What?

00:11:25.418 --> 00:11:27.409
And they said
that they had found it...

00:11:27.453 --> 00:11:29.114
...in an apartment complex
in Machida.

00:11:29.155 --> 00:11:30.986
I learned that later
from one of the staff!

00:11:32.291 --> 00:11:34.191
Ever since my father and I
transferred to the crime lab,

00:11:34.226 --> 00:11:36.990
disgusting samples were brought
to us one after another...

00:11:37.029 --> 00:11:40.362
...and after a while, the special
biology lab was created.

00:11:43.436 --> 00:11:46.599
Okay then, back to work.

00:11:50.276 --> 00:11:53.040
Actually, ever since then,
there have been strange rumors...

00:11:53.079 --> 00:11:55.104
...circulating amongst the staff.

00:11:55.147 --> 00:11:56.512
Rumors?

00:11:56.549 --> 00:11:59.279
Of seeing devils eating people.

00:11:59.318 --> 00:12:01.548
And around the same time,

00:12:01.587 --> 00:12:04.055
there was a succession
of staffers going missing...

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:05.819
It couldn't be...

00:12:05.858 --> 00:12:08.691
I'm scared.

00:12:08.728 --> 00:12:10.889
If my father's research is...

00:12:17.436 --> 00:12:18.926
What's the meaning of this?

00:12:18.971 --> 00:12:20.495
Nothing.

00:12:20.539 --> 00:12:22.131
The mandatory investigation
of the crime lab

00:12:22.174 --> 00:12:23.163
has been rejected.

00:12:23.209 --> 00:12:24.198
That's all.

00:12:24.243 --> 00:12:26.541
But you just said that the request
had gone through...

00:12:26.579 --> 00:12:28.547
And I'm telling you, it was stopped
right afterwards.

00:12:28.581 --> 00:12:31.277
You understand, right, Chief,
that we suspect that the proof...

00:12:31.317 --> 00:12:34.343
from the scattered body part murders
has been secreted away there?

00:12:34.386 --> 00:12:36.445
Did you look at our paperwork!?

00:12:36.489 --> 00:12:38.821
Yeah, I scrutinized it
long and hard.

00:12:38.858 --> 00:12:41.088
Enough that I saw
that one of your rookies...

00:12:41.127 --> 00:12:44.756
...illegally trespassed
into the crime lab!

00:12:44.797 --> 00:12:46.594
If you understand,
then hurry up and leave.

00:12:48.801 --> 00:12:50.166
Don't mess with me!

00:12:50.202 --> 00:12:52.762
How many of my guys do you think
have died so far!?

00:12:52.805 --> 00:12:55.399
You idiot,
don't underestimate me!

00:12:55.441 --> 00:12:57.033
Who's getting in my way!?

00:12:57.076 --> 00:13:00.978
Please calm down, Chief!
Excuse us, then, sir!

00:13:08.988 --> 00:13:10.353
And this is?

00:13:10.389 --> 00:13:12.050
He's my guest.

00:13:12.091 --> 00:13:13.456
I'm sorry,

00:13:13.492 --> 00:13:15.187
but people
without special permission...

00:13:15.227 --> 00:13:16.956
...are not allowed to enter.

00:13:16.996 --> 00:13:20.227
What? But you
let him in before.

00:13:20.266 --> 00:13:21.460
That's the rule.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:25.027
Please ask the head of security!
He is not anyone suspicious!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.059
He's from the Metropolitan
Police.

00:13:26.105 --> 00:13:29.939
Hey, I just want to see
Director Shiraishi, that's all.

00:13:31.744 --> 00:13:32.938
Hold on one second.

00:13:34.113 --> 00:13:36.411
R-Ranmaru!?

00:13:36.448 --> 00:13:37.472
Huh?

00:13:37.516 --> 00:13:38.847
Well, this is a problem.

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.184
You're Detective Shindo
from the Metropolitan Police's

00:13:43.222 --> 00:13:44.553
Special Mobile
Investigation Force, right?

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:45.614
Huh?

00:13:45.658 --> 00:13:47.785
It looks like Director Shiraishi
will see you.

00:13:51.096 --> 00:13:53.257
Wow, the way
I'm being treated this time...

00:13:53.299 --> 00:13:55.290
...is really different than before,
you know?

00:13:58.137 --> 00:14:00.605
Ranmaru, that's...

00:14:00.639 --> 00:14:03.199
I at least need to carry this
on me, you know?

00:14:06.045 --> 00:14:07.205
Father.

00:14:08.514 --> 00:14:09.708
So it's you, is it?

00:14:09.748 --> 00:14:10.737
Hello.

00:14:10.783 --> 00:14:12.614
I'm sorry about before.

00:14:12.651 --> 00:14:15.677
It was right after some
unpleasantness involving my work.

00:14:15.721 --> 00:14:16.710
Right...

00:14:16.755 --> 00:14:18.723
Father, there's something
we want to ask.

00:14:18.757 --> 00:14:20.987
Yukino, go back to work.

00:14:23.028 --> 00:14:26.623
Why? Why are you always
like this?

00:14:26.665 --> 00:14:28.997
Why won't you talk to me?

00:14:30.569 --> 00:14:33.265
It wasn't this way
when mother was alive!

00:14:33.305 --> 00:14:34.772
Yukino...

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:43.944
So what is it you say
you want with me?

00:14:43.983 --> 00:14:46.884
Well, to get straight
to the point,

00:14:46.919 --> 00:14:48.682
I want to know what it is
you're researching.

00:14:48.721 --> 00:14:50.188
My research?

00:14:50.222 --> 00:14:52.349
I've heard that you're examining
monsters.

00:14:53.859 --> 00:14:55.554
And who in the world
said that?

00:14:55.594 --> 00:14:57.824
Well, it was a rumor,
I guess.

00:14:57.863 --> 00:15:01.697
And when I snuck in here before,
I ran into one.

00:15:03.135 --> 00:15:06.593
One that looks just like the monster's
hand that you're researching.

00:15:06.639 --> 00:15:11.042
I see, so you're the one who was
trespassing that day.

00:15:11.076 --> 00:15:12.976
In which case,
let me apologize.

00:15:13.012 --> 00:15:15.480
After all, even if
you were trespassing,

00:15:15.514 --> 00:15:18.210
the guards did shoot at you
all of the sudden.

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.515
Jeez, you're talking like someone
from the Security Section.

00:15:21.553 --> 00:15:24.647
What in the world
are those monsters, really?

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.885
Why are you hiding
the evidence?

00:15:26.926 --> 00:15:28.154
What are you talking about?

00:15:28.193 --> 00:15:30.627
How about I answer for you?

00:15:30.663 --> 00:15:32.654
You're making monsters,
aren't you?

00:15:32.698 --> 00:15:36.031
Those monsters are going berserk
and killing lots of people!

00:15:36.068 --> 00:15:37.899
You're wrong.

00:15:37.937 --> 00:15:41.395
Supposing I were to make these
unique creatures...

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.271
...monsters, as you call them.

00:15:43.309 --> 00:15:47.405
But why would they
be killing people?

00:15:47.446 --> 00:15:49.641
There's no reason for it.

00:15:49.682 --> 00:15:52.242
I understand the investigation
of the series of murders...

00:15:52.284 --> 00:15:53.717
...has come to a standstill.

00:15:53.752 --> 00:15:57.711
As a result, various rumors
and speculation are flying about.

00:15:57.756 --> 00:16:00.589
This isn't speculation!
I saw it!

00:16:00.626 --> 00:16:03.561
And that monster was in a book
that was here!

00:16:03.595 --> 00:16:06.029
It looks like you've seen some
of Yukino's research...

00:16:06.065 --> 00:16:07.862
...and gotten confused.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.731
In other words,
this is what you mean.

00:16:09.768 --> 00:16:13.829
In the middle ages, a certain
aristocratic family...

00:16:13.872 --> 00:16:15.737
...ordered an alchemist
to call forth a devil.

00:16:15.774 --> 00:16:16.968
In order to do this,

00:16:17.009 --> 00:16:18.476
the gate that separates
the human world...

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:21.240
...and the underworld
had to be opened.

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:25.011
And so the alchemist created
the Box of Druj,

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:27.280
made up of 108 parts.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:32.286
Actually, that box itself became
the gate to the underworld...

00:16:33.158 --> 00:16:36.685
The devils passed through the gate
to the human world and appeared,

00:16:36.729 --> 00:16:38.924
one after the other,
and started eating people.

00:16:39.932 --> 00:16:44.164
The aristocrats, frightened, ordered
the alchemist to close the gate.

00:16:44.203 --> 00:16:45.261
But by that point,

00:16:45.304 --> 00:16:48.933
the Box of Druj had already
become 108 devils.

00:16:50.109 --> 00:16:53.875
Until all of the devils are slain
and the gate is closed,

00:16:53.912 --> 00:16:57.678
people will continue to get eaten
by the devils.

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:04.546
Of course,
this is just a legend.

00:17:04.590 --> 00:17:06.421
Actually, I heard this
a little while ago,

00:17:06.458 --> 00:17:08.722
but there was a drug addict...

00:17:08.761 --> 00:17:11.389
...who thought that he was
one of the devils...

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:13.864
...and murdered
a lot of people.

00:17:13.899 --> 00:17:15.491
That addict
kept killing people...

00:17:15.534 --> 00:17:19.630
...because he was trying
to eat everyone.

00:17:19.671 --> 00:17:22.663
And so, working with a group
of detectives, we investigated...

00:17:22.708 --> 00:17:27.441
...the composition of the drug
and the origins of the legend.

00:17:27.479 --> 00:17:30.778
To say that we're suppressing
evidence is absurd.

00:17:30.816 --> 00:17:35.651
This is the truth behind the rash
of scattered body part murders.

00:17:35.687 --> 00:17:36.745
H-Hold on a second.

00:17:36.789 --> 00:17:39.053
And with this, your doubts
have been cleared up.

00:17:39.091 --> 00:17:40.217
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:17:40.259 --> 00:17:43.751
Hey! Wait up!
We're not finished talking!

00:18:19.498 --> 00:18:22.797
So he really is...

00:18:22.835 --> 00:18:25.201
Don't get any closer
than this to them.

00:18:42.855 --> 00:18:45.688
So you've finally
shown yourselves.

00:18:45.724 --> 00:18:47.749
A drug addict. Yeah, right.

00:18:49.194 --> 00:18:51.992
You just don't give up,
do you?

00:18:52.798 --> 00:18:55.358
People like you...

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:58.028
You... Director Shiraishi?

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:02.131
Damn it, so you really are working
with the devils!

00:19:02.174 --> 00:19:04.438
I'd prefer it if you didn't
get me wrong.

00:19:04.476 --> 00:19:07.468
I want to save humanity
from the things...

00:19:07.513 --> 00:19:10.038
...that you have run into.

00:19:10.082 --> 00:19:12.846
It's just that my methods
are a little bit different from yours.

00:19:12.885 --> 00:19:13.874
What?

00:19:13.919 --> 00:19:15.910
This devil's hand is wonderful...

00:19:17.589 --> 00:19:20.820
It has the power
to save the world.

00:19:20.859 --> 00:19:23.794
You bastard, have you reduced
yourself to being a devil!?

00:19:23.829 --> 00:19:25.797
No, this is evolution.

00:19:27.332 --> 00:19:29.027
What in the world are these!?

00:19:29.067 --> 00:19:31.501
They share my vision.

00:19:31.537 --> 00:19:32.526
It can't be!

00:19:32.571 --> 00:19:37.508
Humanity can no longer
escape its fate...

00:19:37.543 --> 00:19:40.103
This time, we will absorb
your flesh!

00:19:52.457 --> 00:19:55.153
You still don't understand?
It's no use.

00:20:02.868 --> 00:20:06.235
I had wanted you to see things
my way, were it possible.

00:20:06.271 --> 00:20:07.397
Cut the crap!

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.504
Ranmaru!

00:20:18.483 --> 00:20:19.916
Yukino!

00:20:22.754 --> 00:20:25.450
Father, please stop...

00:20:25.490 --> 00:20:26.980
Yukino.

00:20:27.025 --> 00:20:29.118
I knew...

00:20:29.161 --> 00:20:31.755
But, Father, I never thought
you would...

00:20:31.797 --> 00:20:34.027
This is for your sake too.

00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:35.533
What are you saying?

00:20:35.567 --> 00:20:37.228
You don't understand anything.

00:20:37.269 --> 00:20:38.258
Huh?

00:20:38.303 --> 00:20:41.864
At this rate, all humanity can do
is wait for its own destruction.

00:20:41.907 --> 00:20:44.740
There is no other way
for it to survive.

00:20:44.776 --> 00:20:48.143
Yukino, eat this.
If you do, you'll be saved!

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:50.011
No.

00:20:50.048 --> 00:20:53.313
Father, you...
made the staffers...

00:20:53.352 --> 00:20:54.341
What?

00:20:54.386 --> 00:20:57.287
If I would have to survive
knowing that...

00:20:57.322 --> 00:21:00.314
...I would rather choose the road
to dying as a human!

00:21:00.359 --> 00:21:02.054
Yukino...

00:21:02.094 --> 00:21:05.188
That's why... I want you...

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:07.698
...to stop this.

00:21:07.733 --> 00:21:10.065
Is this the salvation
you were talking about!?

00:21:15.107 --> 00:21:18.440
I see... so it really was
a symbiont...

00:21:18.477 --> 00:21:20.308
Symbiont?

00:21:20.345 --> 00:21:24.714
Shindo, do you understand
what you are?

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.810
And what that really means?

00:21:27.853 --> 00:21:29.081
W-What are you talking about?

00:21:29.121 --> 00:21:32.454
That legend isn't made up.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:35.949
Yukino!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.299
How unusual. Mimic beasts.

00:21:50.342 --> 00:21:51.502
Hurry up!

00:22:41.660 --> 00:22:46.427
I held that hand

00:22:46.465 --> 00:22:51.402
And we kissed

00:22:51.436 --> 00:22:56.203
After a little while

00:22:56.241 --> 00:23:01.110
It will quietly become
our final day

00:23:01.146 --> 00:23:07.574
Please, no matter what,
never forget

00:23:08.820 --> 00:23:11.220
Sherry, far away

00:23:11.256 --> 00:23:13.656
Sherry, it was with you

00:23:13.692 --> 00:23:18.595
That I laughed

00:23:18.630 --> 00:23:20.996
Sherry, far away

00:23:21.032 --> 00:23:23.432
Sherry, it was you

00:23:23.468 --> 00:23:28.098
That I held

00:23:28.140 --> 00:23:30.438
I sung the memories

00:23:30.475 --> 00:23:32.966
Forever melodies

00:23:33.011 --> 00:23:35.241
I sung the memories

00:23:37.983 --> 00:23:40.315
I sung the memories

00:23:40.352 --> 00:23:42.843
Forever melodies

00:23:42.888 --> 00:23:45.083
I sung the memories

00:23:48.126 --> 00:23:50.356
Sherry, far away

00:23:50.429 --> 00:23:52.897
Sherry, far away

00:23:52.931 --> 00:23:59.962
I know you can find
my melodies

00:24:03.909 --> 00:24:05.877
A past that cannot
be spoken of.

00:24:07.846 --> 00:24:09.211
You're like me.

00:24:11.249 --> 00:24:13.183
I killed him.

00:24:14.252 --> 00:24:16.686
And destiny.

00:24:17.823 --> 00:24:19.814
On the next episode of Tokko:

00:24:22.127 --> 00:24:23.492
Sadness.

00:24:25.964 --> 00:24:30.901
Sadness
